<title>USA: AGL Resources acquires propane distributor.</title>
<headline>AGL Resources acquires propane distributor.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia Gas Service Co said it had purchased Capitol Fuels Inc, a retail propane distribution company with 5,300 customers.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Capitol Fuels, which is based in Blairsville, Ga., had sales of about 3.3 million gallons in Blairsville, and in Murphy and Cherokee, N.C.</p>
<p>Georgia Gas, a subsidiary of AGL Resources Inc, will now serve more than 43,000 customers.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
